    },
    {
      "text": "[innocent] Missä se on?",
      "voice_id": "Gp43kq9FsSlavD7esRtx",
      "lang": "fi"
    },
    {
      "text": "[deadpan] He's asking where that is. He knows. He's teasing you.",
      "voice_id": "nJ8YqEenIxs18T0Hu4QE",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "In Finnish, the beat is always on the first part of the word.",
      "voice_id": "nJ8YqEenIxs18T0Hu4QE",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "[slowly] Helsinki.",
      "voice_id": "nJ8YqEenIxs18T0Hu4QE",
      "lang": "fi"
    },
    {
      "text": "[laughing] Okay, okay.",
      "voice_id": "vnJXCu1mkdsxb9UdCYZp",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "[carefully] Helsinki.",
      "voice_id": "vnJXCu1mkdsxb9UdCYZp",
      "lang": "fi"
    },
    {
      "text": "[nods] Every word works like that. Restaurant.",
      "voice_id": "nJ8YqEenIxs18T0Hu4QE",
      "lang": "en"
    },
    {
      "text": "[slowly] Ravintola.",
